; Handwriting-Robot G-code -- web job owen
; author=owen strokes=8 scale=1.000
; steps/mm  X=80.000  Y=80.000 (3200 microsteps/rev)
; pen: one-way gear motor, M5=up M3=down, each = one 90deg pulse
